    "created_at": "2017-11-10T00:21:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-10T00:21:51Z",
    "body": "Yeah, report an exception is not right; that would essentially mean adding [CEReactions] to APIs causes them to stop throwing exceptions despite their spec text.\r\n\r\nMy thinking is that it should essentially do\r\n\r\n```js\r\ntry {\r\n  runAlgorithm();\r\n} finally {\r\n  runReactions(); // never throws, only reports exceptions\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat's what I intend to spec when I have a spare moment, although TPAC makes that a bit tricky.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/343335396/reactions",
